"citation_ids":["cite.long.cor-tr-half-lcm"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.cor-tr-half-lcm"],"id":"long.cor-tr-half-lcm","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Corollary 8.7 (Half-LCM horizon)","locator":"Long record Corollary 8.7, p. 95, label cor:tr-half-lcm","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $J\\ge2$ and $L_J:=\\mathrm{lcm}(2,3,\\ldots,J)$. For every $n\\ge\\max\\{4,L_J/2+1\\}$ there is an $M\\in[n,2n-2]$ with $\\mu_J(M)<11/15$. Thus witness exclusion leaves only the finite window $[4,L_J/2]$ to check.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.cor-tr-half-lcm","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.cor-tr-half-lcm","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.cor-tr-half-lcm%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_half_lcm_horizon%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.cor-tr-half-lcm%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_half_lcm_horizon%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_half_lcm_horizon"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.cor-tr-half-lcm","id":"field:03181a94c70014964c8542df7ba46370209d20146e1e8ceeffa7c0df8461902c","kind":"source_id","owner_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.cor-tr-half-lcm","semantic_class":"provenance_field_reference","source_field":"source_id","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/sources/paper.long.pdf"},